!!! A 'context' annotation the artifact has nowhere to put.
!!!
!!! A paragraph, record, class and choice each have a declaration in the
!!! emitted NIL and carry their own annotations. A contract emits nothing at
!!! all, so there is no place to put one -- which is a property of the
!!! artifact, not a feature waiting to be written. Refusing is right:
!!! documented intent that silently is not in the artifact is worse than no
!!! intent at all, because nothing reveals the difference.
book diagnostic.context-on-a-contract

context "Anything the compositor can draw."
Drawable begin contract
    draw returns nothing
end contract

main returns number begin paragraph
    give 0
end paragraph
